UPDATE site_content SET `title`='TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability',`title_en`='TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability',`title_zh`='TZME 成功向美国硼砂公司供应高性能笼式磨机备件，严格动平衡检测保障可靠性',`category`='News',`category_en`='News',`category_zh`='公司新闻',`summary`='Tianjin, July 10, 2026 – TZME announced that it has successfully delivered two sets of high‑performance cage mill spare parts to U.S. Borax, a globally leading borate producer, for use in its core crushing process. The two parties have established a strong working relationship through this collaboration.',`summary_en`='Tianjin, July 10, 2026 – TZME announced that it has successfully delivered two sets of high‑performance cage mill spare parts to U.S. Borax, a globally leading borate producer, for use in its core crushing process. The two parties have established a strong working relationship through this collaboration.',`summary_zh`='天津，2026年7月10日——TZME 宣布，已向全球领先的硼酸盐生产商美国硼砂公司（U.S. Borax）成功交付两套高性能笼式磨机备件，用于其核心破碎工序。双方通过此次合作建立了牢固的合作关系。',`content`='<p><strong>U.S. Borax</strong>, a subsidiary of Rio Tinto, operates a world‑class mine in Boron, California, supplying approximately 30% of the world’s refined borate products. As one of the oldest mining companies in the United States, it employs around 1,000 people and serves 500 customers worldwide.</p><p>As a qualified spare parts supplier, TZME provided these cage mill components for the routine operation and maintenance of U.S. Borax’s ore crushing line. The products underwent stringent control from material selection to machining processes. Notably, each unit was 100% subjected to dynamic balancing testing in accordance with international standards before shipment, ensuring stability and reliability at high rotational speeds, effectively reducing vibration and wear, and significantly extending equipment service life.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-02.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><blockquote><p><strong>Hannah, Market Development Manager at TZME, commented:</strong> “Being able to supply critical crushing equipment spare parts to a world‑class mining company like U.S. Borax is a strong validation of our product quality and technical expertise. Dynamic balancing testing is our fundamental quality commitment for every high‑speed rotating spare part. We see this as a stepping stone to further penetrate the North American mining market and provide more mining customers with highly reliable, precision‑engineered spare parts and technical services.</p></blockquote><p>This partnership marks another major breakthrough for TZME in the North American mining supply chain, particularly in the niche segment of crushing equipment spare parts. The company will continue to uphold its vision – <em>“To be the leader of global non‑standard mechanical manufacturers”</em> – and deliver reliable complete machines and spare part solutions to mining customers worldwide.</p><p></p><hr /><p><strong>About TZME（Tianjin) Co., Ltd.</strong><br />TZME specializes in custom‑built, non‑standard machinery and equipment for the international market. Our diverse portfolio includes: port machinery, mining machinery, bridge construction equipment, tourist sightseeing facilities, handling &amp; conveying systems, lifting equipment, metallurgical equipment, pressure vessels, environmental protection equipment, and special boats. With an annual comprehensive production capacity exceeding 45,000 tons, our products are trusted by a roster of internationally renowned clients and exported to more than 60 countries and regions, including the USA, Germany, Australia, Brazil, Japan, South Africa, Canada, Denmark, and South Korea.</p><p>We have extensive experience in mining machinery manufacturing, and our equipment and spare parts have served multiple major mines. Our involvement in North American mining projects includes: New Afton (Copper Mine), Red Chris (Copper‑Gold Mine), James Bay, IOC (Iron Ore), Retrofit Mine (Zinc Mine), MFQ (Gold‑Copper Mine), and Marathon Gold (Valentine Gold Mine).</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-03.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><p><strong>For more information, please contact us!</strong></p><p><br /></p>',`content_en`='<p><strong>U.S. Borax</strong>, a subsidiary of Rio Tinto, operates a world‑class mine in Boron, California, supplying approximately 30% of the world’s refined borate products. As one of the oldest mining companies in the United States, it employs around 1,000 people and serves 500 customers worldwide.</p><p>As a qualified spare parts supplier, TZME provided these cage mill components for the routine operation and maintenance of U.S. Borax’s ore crushing line. The products underwent stringent control from material selection to machining processes. Notably, each unit was 100% subjected to dynamic balancing testing in accordance with international standards before shipment, ensuring stability and reliability at high rotational speeds, effectively reducing vibration and wear, and significantly extending equipment service life.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-02.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><blockquote><p><strong>Hannah, Market Development Manager at TZME, commented:</strong> “Being able to supply critical crushing equipment spare parts to a world‑class mining company like U.S. Borax is a strong validation of our product quality and technical expertise. Dynamic balancing testing is our fundamental quality commitment for every high‑speed rotating spare part. We see this as a stepping stone to further penetrate the North American mining market and provide more mining customers with highly reliable, precision‑engineered spare parts and technical services.</p></blockquote><p>This partnership marks another major breakthrough for TZME in the North American mining supply chain, particularly in the niche segment of crushing equipment spare parts. The company will continue to uphold its vision – <em>“To be the leader of global non‑standard mechanical manufacturers”</em> – and deliver reliable complete machines and spare part solutions to mining customers worldwide.</p><p></p><hr /><p><strong>About TZME（Tianjin) Co., Ltd.</strong><br />TZME specializes in custom‑built, non‑standard machinery and equipment for the international market. Our diverse portfolio includes: port machinery, mining machinery, bridge construction equipment, tourist sightseeing facilities, handling &amp; conveying systems, lifting equipment, metallurgical equipment, pressure vessels, environmental protection equipment, and special boats. With an annual comprehensive production capacity exceeding 45,000 tons, our products are trusted by a roster of internationally renowned clients and exported to more than 60 countries and regions, including the USA, Germany, Australia, Brazil, Japan, South Africa, Canada, Denmark, and South Korea.</p><p>We have extensive experience in mining machinery manufacturing, and our equipment and spare parts have served multiple major mines. Our involvement in North American mining projects includes: New Afton (Copper Mine), Red Chris (Copper‑Gold Mine), James Bay, IOC (Iron Ore), Retrofit Mine (Zinc Mine), MFQ (Gold‑Copper Mine), and Marathon Gold (Valentine Gold Mine).</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-03.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><p><strong>For more information, please contact us!</strong></p><p><br /></p>',`content_zh`='<p><strong>美国硼砂公司（U.S. Borax）</strong>是力拓集团旗下企业，在加利福尼亚州博朗运营一座世界级矿山，供应全球约 30% 的精制硼酸盐产品。作为美国历史最悠久的矿业公司之一，该公司拥有约 1,000 名员工，为全球 500 家客户提供服务。</p>
<p>作为合格的备件供应商，TZME 提供的这些笼式磨机部件用于美国硼砂公司矿石破碎生产线的日常运行与维护。从选材到机械加工，各环节均经过严格控制。值得一提的是，每套产品在发运前均按照国际标准进行了 100% 动平衡检测，确保高速旋转状态下的稳定性和可靠性，有效降低振动与磨损，并显著延长设备使用寿命。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-02.jpg" alt="美国硼砂公司笼式磨机备件与动平衡检测" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<blockquote><p><strong>TZME 市场开发经理 Hannah 表示：</strong>“能够为美国硼砂公司这样的世界级矿业企业供应关键破碎设备备件，是对我们产品质量和技术能力的有力认可。动平衡检测是我们对每一件高速旋转备件的基本质量承诺。我们将以此为契机，进一步拓展北美矿业市场，为更多矿业客户提供高可靠性、精密制造的备件和技术服务。”</p></blockquote>
<p>此次合作标志着 TZME 在北美矿业供应链，尤其是破碎设备备件这一细分领域取得了又一重要突破。公司将继续秉持<em>“成为全球非标机械设备制造领域的领导者”</em>的愿景，为全球矿业客户提供可靠的整机及备件解决方案。</p>
<hr /><h2>关于 TZME（天津）有限公司</h2>
<p>TZME 专注于为国际市场提供定制化、非标机械设备。产品组合丰富，包括港口机械、采矿机械、桥梁建设设备、旅游观光设施、装卸与输送系统、起重设备、冶金设备、压力容器、环保设备以及特种船舶。年综合生产能力超过 45,000 吨，产品受到众多国际知名客户的信赖，并出口至美国、德国、澳大利亚、巴西、日本、南非、加拿大、丹麦和韩国等 60 多个国家和地区。</p>
<p>我们在矿山机械制造方面拥有丰富经验，设备及备件已服务于多座大型矿山。参与的北美矿业项目包括 New Afton（铜矿）、Red Chris（铜金矿）、James Bay、IOC（铁矿）、Retrofit Mine（锌矿）、MFQ（金铜矿）以及 Marathon Gold（Valentine 金矿）。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-03.jpg" alt="TZME 参与的矿业项目及装备制造资料" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<p><strong>如需了解更多信息，欢迎联系我们！</strong></p>',`image`='/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-01.jpg',`date`='2026-07-14',`status`='published',`show_on_home`=0,`home_order`=1 WHERE id='borax-cage-mill' AND type='articles' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM app_migrations WHERE id='2026-10-27-official-newsroom-v1');
INSERT INTO site_content (`id`,`type`,`title`,`title_en`,`title_zh`,`category`,`category_en`,`category_zh`,`summary`,`summary_en`,`summary_zh`,`content`,`content_en`,`content_zh`,`image`,`date`,`status`,`show_on_home`,`home_order`) SELECT 'borax-cage-mill','articles','TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability','TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability','TZME 成功向美国硼砂公司供应高性能笼式磨机备件，严格动平衡检测保障可靠性','News','News','公司新闻','Tianjin, July 10, 2026 – TZME announced that it has successfully delivered two sets of high‑performance cage mill spare parts to U.S. Borax, a globally leading borate producer, for use in its core crushing process. The two parties have established a strong working relationship through this collaboration.','Tianjin, July 10, 2026 – TZME announced that it has successfully delivered two sets of high‑performance cage mill spare parts to U.S. Borax, a globally leading borate producer, for use in its core crushing process. The two parties have established a strong working relationship through this collaboration.','天津，2026年7月10日——TZME 宣布，已向全球领先的硼酸盐生产商美国硼砂公司（U.S. Borax）成功交付两套高性能笼式磨机备件，用于其核心破碎工序。双方通过此次合作建立了牢固的合作关系。','<p><strong>U.S. Borax</strong>, a subsidiary of Rio Tinto, operates a world‑class mine in Boron, California, supplying approximately 30% of the world’s refined borate products. As one of the oldest mining companies in the United States, it employs around 1,000 people and serves 500 customers worldwide.</p><p>As a qualified spare parts supplier, TZME provided these cage mill components for the routine operation and maintenance of U.S. Borax’s ore crushing line. The products underwent stringent control from material selection to machining processes. Notably, each unit was 100% subjected to dynamic balancing testing in accordance with international standards before shipment, ensuring stability and reliability at high rotational speeds, effectively reducing vibration and wear, and significantly extending equipment service life.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-02.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><blockquote><p><strong>Hannah, Market Development Manager at TZME, commented:</strong> “Being able to supply critical crushing equipment spare parts to a world‑class mining company like U.S. Borax is a strong validation of our product quality and technical expertise. Dynamic balancing testing is our fundamental quality commitment for every high‑speed rotating spare part. We see this as a stepping stone to further penetrate the North American mining market and provide more mining customers with highly reliable, precision‑engineered spare parts and technical services.</p></blockquote><p>This partnership marks another major breakthrough for TZME in the North American mining supply chain, particularly in the niche segment of crushing equipment spare parts. The company will continue to uphold its vision – <em>“To be the leader of global non‑standard mechanical manufacturers”</em> – and deliver reliable complete machines and spare part solutions to mining customers worldwide.</p><p></p><hr /><p><strong>About TZME（Tianjin) Co., Ltd.</strong><br />TZME specializes in custom‑built, non‑standard machinery and equipment for the international market. Our diverse portfolio includes: port machinery, mining machinery, bridge construction equipment, tourist sightseeing facilities, handling &amp; conveying systems, lifting equipment, metallurgical equipment, pressure vessels, environmental protection equipment, and special boats. With an annual comprehensive production capacity exceeding 45,000 tons, our products are trusted by a roster of internationally renowned clients and exported to more than 60 countries and regions, including the USA, Germany, Australia, Brazil, Japan, South Africa, Canada, Denmark, and South Korea.</p><p>We have extensive experience in mining machinery manufacturing, and our equipment and spare parts have served multiple major mines. Our involvement in North American mining projects includes: New Afton (Copper Mine), Red Chris (Copper‑Gold Mine), James Bay, IOC (Iron Ore), Retrofit Mine (Zinc Mine), MFQ (Gold‑Copper Mine), and Marathon Gold (Valentine Gold Mine).</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-03.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><p><strong>For more information, please contact us!</strong></p><p><br /></p>','<p><strong>U.S. Borax</strong>, a subsidiary of Rio Tinto, operates a world‑class mine in Boron, California, supplying approximately 30% of the world’s refined borate products. As one of the oldest mining companies in the United States, it employs around 1,000 people and serves 500 customers worldwide.</p><p>As a qualified spare parts supplier, TZME provided these cage mill components for the routine operation and maintenance of U.S. Borax’s ore crushing line. The products underwent stringent control from material selection to machining processes. Notably, each unit was 100% subjected to dynamic balancing testing in accordance with international standards before shipment, ensuring stability and reliability at high rotational speeds, effectively reducing vibration and wear, and significantly extending equipment service life.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-02.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><blockquote><p><strong>Hannah, Market Development Manager at TZME, commented:</strong> “Being able to supply critical crushing equipment spare parts to a world‑class mining company like U.S. Borax is a strong validation of our product quality and technical expertise. Dynamic balancing testing is our fundamental quality commitment for every high‑speed rotating spare part. We see this as a stepping stone to further penetrate the North American mining market and provide more mining customers with highly reliable, precision‑engineered spare parts and technical services.</p></blockquote><p>This partnership marks another major breakthrough for TZME in the North American mining supply chain, particularly in the niche segment of crushing equipment spare parts. The company will continue to uphold its vision – <em>“To be the leader of global non‑standard mechanical manufacturers”</em> – and deliver reliable complete machines and spare part solutions to mining customers worldwide.</p><p></p><hr /><p><strong>About TZME（Tianjin) Co., Ltd.</strong><br />TZME specializes in custom‑built, non‑standard machinery and equipment for the international market. Our diverse portfolio includes: port machinery, mining machinery, bridge construction equipment, tourist sightseeing facilities, handling &amp; conveying systems, lifting equipment, metallurgical equipment, pressure vessels, environmental protection equipment, and special boats. With an annual comprehensive production capacity exceeding 45,000 tons, our products are trusted by a roster of internationally renowned clients and exported to more than 60 countries and regions, including the USA, Germany, Australia, Brazil, Japan, South Africa, Canada, Denmark, and South Korea.</p><p>We have extensive experience in mining machinery manufacturing, and our equipment and spare parts have served multiple major mines. Our involvement in North American mining projects includes: New Afton (Copper Mine), Red Chris (Copper‑Gold Mine), James Bay, IOC (Iron Ore), Retrofit Mine (Zinc Mine), MFQ (Gold‑Copper Mine), and Marathon Gold (Valentine Gold Mine).</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-03.jpg" alt="TZME Successfully Supplies High‑Performance Cage Mill Spare Parts to U.S. Borax with Rigorous Dynamic Balancing Testing Ensuring Reliability" /></p><p><strong>For more information, please contact us!</strong></p><p><br /></p>','<p><strong>美国硼砂公司（U.S. Borax）</strong>是力拓集团旗下企业，在加利福尼亚州博朗运营一座世界级矿山，供应全球约 30% 的精制硼酸盐产品。作为美国历史最悠久的矿业公司之一，该公司拥有约 1,000 名员工，为全球 500 家客户提供服务。</p>
<p>作为合格的备件供应商，TZME 提供的这些笼式磨机部件用于美国硼砂公司矿石破碎生产线的日常运行与维护。从选材到机械加工，各环节均经过严格控制。值得一提的是，每套产品在发运前均按照国际标准进行了 100% 动平衡检测，确保高速旋转状态下的稳定性和可靠性，有效降低振动与磨损，并显著延长设备使用寿命。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-02.jpg" alt="美国硼砂公司笼式磨机备件与动平衡检测" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<blockquote><p><strong>TZME 市场开发经理 Hannah 表示：</strong>“能够为美国硼砂公司这样的世界级矿业企业供应关键破碎设备备件，是对我们产品质量和技术能力的有力认可。动平衡检测是我们对每一件高速旋转备件的基本质量承诺。我们将以此为契机，进一步拓展北美矿业市场，为更多矿业客户提供高可靠性、精密制造的备件和技术服务。”</p></blockquote>
<p>此次合作标志着 TZME 在北美矿业供应链，尤其是破碎设备备件这一细分领域取得了又一重要突破。公司将继续秉持<em>“成为全球非标机械设备制造领域的领导者”</em>的愿景，为全球矿业客户提供可靠的整机及备件解决方案。</p>
<hr /><h2>关于 TZME（天津）有限公司</h2>
<p>TZME 专注于为国际市场提供定制化、非标机械设备。产品组合丰富，包括港口机械、采矿机械、桥梁建设设备、旅游观光设施、装卸与输送系统、起重设备、冶金设备、压力容器、环保设备以及特种船舶。年综合生产能力超过 45,000 吨，产品受到众多国际知名客户的信赖，并出口至美国、德国、澳大利亚、巴西、日本、南非、加拿大、丹麦和韩国等 60 多个国家和地区。</p>
<p>我们在矿山机械制造方面拥有丰富经验，设备及备件已服务于多座大型矿山。参与的北美矿业项目包括 New Afton（铜矿）、Red Chris（铜金矿）、James Bay、IOC（铁矿）、Retrofit Mine（锌矿）、MFQ（金铜矿）以及 Marathon Gold（Valentine 金矿）。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-03.jpg" alt="TZME 参与的矿业项目及装备制造资料" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<p><strong>如需了解更多信息，欢迎联系我们！</strong></p>','/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/borax-cage-mill-01.jpg','2026-07-14','published',0,1 WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM app_migrations WHERE id='2026-10-27-official-newsroom-v1') AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM site_content WHERE id='borax-cage-mill');
UPDATE site_content SET `title`='TZME Successfully Debuted at Tokyo Exhibition, Secured Multiple High-Quality Business Talks',`title_en`='TZME Successfully Debuted at Tokyo Exhibition, Secured Multiple High-Quality Business Talks',`title_zh`='TZME 成功亮相东京展会，达成多项高质量商务洽谈',`category`='News',`category_en`='News',`category_zh`='公司新闻',`summary`='TOKYO, Japan – Recently, TZME participated in the N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) held in Tokyo. During the exhibition, the TZME team engaged in in-depth discussions with several Japanese and international clients, focusing on technical collaboration and market expansion.',`summary_en`='TOKYO, Japan – Recently, TZME participated in the N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) held in Tokyo. During the exhibition, the TZME team engaged in in-depth discussions with several Japanese and international clients, focusing on technical collaboration and market expansion.',`summary_zh`='日本东京——近日，TZME 参加了在东京举办的 N-EXPO（东京国际环保展）。展会期间，TZME 团队与多家日本及国际客户开展深入交流，重点探讨技术合作与市场拓展。',`content`='<p>The N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) is the largest environmental exhibition in Asia, featuring over 1,300 booths and more than 700 international exhibitors. </p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-02.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>This participation not only showcased TZME''s mature projects in port machinery, transportation equipment, mining machinery, amusement equipments, as well as the latest models of mobile modular prefabricated houses, but also brought the company closer to overseas clients. As a first-time exhibitor at an international trade fair, our booth attracted considerable attention from international equipment suppliers. The MMI modular house models generated lively interest on site, with multiple companies expressing interest in TZME''s manufacturing capabilities and project experience.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-03.jpg" alt="" /><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-04.jpg" alt="" /></p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-05.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>As a professional custom equipment manufacturer serving international clients, TZME has established cooperation with over 100 key clients in more than 60 countries, producing more than 70 product categories. The company is actively expanding into new fields and market opportunities. TZME will continue to serve global clients with professionalism and sincerity, and promote the implementation of more substantive cooperation.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-01.jpg" alt="" /></p>',`content_en`='<p>The N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) is the largest environmental exhibition in Asia, featuring over 1,300 booths and more than 700 international exhibitors. </p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-02.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>This participation not only showcased TZME''s mature projects in port machinery, transportation equipment, mining machinery, amusement equipments, as well as the latest models of mobile modular prefabricated houses, but also brought the company closer to overseas clients. As a first-time exhibitor at an international trade fair, our booth attracted considerable attention from international equipment suppliers. The MMI modular house models generated lively interest on site, with multiple companies expressing interest in TZME''s manufacturing capabilities and project experience.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-03.jpg" alt="" /><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-04.jpg" alt="" /></p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-05.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>As a professional custom equipment manufacturer serving international clients, TZME has established cooperation with over 100 key clients in more than 60 countries, producing more than 70 product categories. The company is actively expanding into new fields and market opportunities. TZME will continue to serve global clients with professionalism and sincerity, and promote the implementation of more substantive cooperation.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-01.jpg" alt="" /></p>',`content_zh`='<p>N-EXPO（东京国际环保展）是亚洲规模最大的环保展会，设有 1,300 多个展位，汇聚 700 多家国际参展商。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-02.jpg" alt="TZME 参加东京 N-EXPO 展会" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<p>此次参展不仅展示了 TZME 在港口机械、运输设备、矿山机械、游乐设备等领域的成熟项目，以及最新款移动式模块化预制房屋，也拉近了公司与海外客户的距离。作为首次参加国际贸易展会的企业，我们的展位吸引了众多国际设备供应商的关注。MMI 模块化房屋模型在现场引发热烈兴趣，多家公司表达了对 TZME 制造能力和项目经验的关注。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-03.jpg" alt="展会现场的模块化房屋模型与客户交流" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-04.jpg" alt="东京展会现场展示" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-05.jpg" alt="TZME 展位与参展交流" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
<p>作为服务国际客户的专业定制设备制造商，TZME 已与 60 多个国家的 100 多家重点客户建立合作，生产 70 多个产品品类。公司正积极拓展新的业务领域和市场机遇。TZME 将继续以专业与真诚服务全球客户，推动更多实质性合作落地。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-01.jpg" alt="TZME 东京展会参展纪实" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>',`image`='/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-01.jpg',`date`='2026-05-27',`status`='published',`show_on_home`=0,`home_order`=2 WHERE id='tokyo-n-expo' AND type='articles' AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM app_migrations WHERE id='2026-10-27-official-newsroom-v1');
INSERT INTO site_content (`id`,`type`,`title`,`title_en`,`title_zh`,`category`,`category_en`,`category_zh`,`summary`,`summary_en`,`summary_zh`,`content`,`content_en`,`content_zh`,`image`,`date`,`status`,`show_on_home`,`home_order`) SELECT 'tokyo-n-expo','articles','TZME Successfully Debuted at Tokyo Exhibition, Secured Multiple High-Quality Business Talks','TZME Successfully Debuted at Tokyo Exhibition, Secured Multiple High-Quality Business Talks','TZME 成功亮相东京展会，达成多项高质量商务洽谈','News','News','公司新闻','TOKYO, Japan – Recently, TZME participated in the N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) held in Tokyo. During the exhibition, the TZME team engaged in in-depth discussions with several Japanese and international clients, focusing on technical collaboration and market expansion.','TOKYO, Japan – Recently, TZME participated in the N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) held in Tokyo. During the exhibition, the TZME team engaged in in-depth discussions with several Japanese and international clients, focusing on technical collaboration and market expansion.','日本东京——近日，TZME 参加了在东京举办的 N-EXPO（东京国际环保展）。展会期间，TZME 团队与多家日本及国际客户开展深入交流，重点探讨技术合作与市场拓展。','<p>The N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) is the largest environmental exhibition in Asia, featuring over 1,300 booths and more than 700 international exhibitors. </p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-02.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>This participation not only showcased TZME''s mature projects in port machinery, transportation equipment, mining machinery, amusement equipments, as well as the latest models of mobile modular prefabricated houses, but also brought the company closer to overseas clients. As a first-time exhibitor at an international trade fair, our booth attracted considerable attention from international equipment suppliers. The MMI modular house models generated lively interest on site, with multiple companies expressing interest in TZME''s manufacturing capabilities and project experience.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-03.jpg" alt="" /><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-04.jpg" alt="" /></p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-05.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>As a professional custom equipment manufacturer serving international clients, TZME has established cooperation with over 100 key clients in more than 60 countries, producing more than 70 product categories. The company is actively expanding into new fields and market opportunities. TZME will continue to serve global clients with professionalism and sincerity, and promote the implementation of more substantive cooperation.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-01.jpg" alt="" /></p>','<p>The N-EXPO (Tokyo International Exhibition on Environmental Protection) is the largest environmental exhibition in Asia, featuring over 1,300 booths and more than 700 international exhibitors. </p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-02.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>This participation not only showcased TZME''s mature projects in port machinery, transportation equipment, mining machinery, amusement equipments, as well as the latest models of mobile modular prefabricated houses, but also brought the company closer to overseas clients. As a first-time exhibitor at an international trade fair, our booth attracted considerable attention from international equipment suppliers. The MMI modular house models generated lively interest on site, with multiple companies expressing interest in TZME''s manufacturing capabilities and project experience.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-03.jpg" alt="" /><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-04.jpg" alt="" /></p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-05.jpg" alt="" /></p><p>As a professional custom equipment manufacturer serving international clients, TZME has established cooperation with over 100 key clients in more than 60 countries, producing more than 70 product categories. The company is actively expanding into new fields and market opportunities. TZME will continue to serve global clients with professionalism and sincerity, and promote the implementation of more substantive cooperation.</p><p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-01.jpg" alt="" /></p>','<p>N-EXPO（东京国际环保展）是亚洲规模最大的环保展会，设有 1,300 多个展位，汇聚 700 多家国际参展商。</p>
<p><img src="/assets/tzme-newsroom/images/tokyo-n-expo-02.jpg" alt="TZME 参加东京 N-EXPO 展会" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></p>
